<!-- This file defines the Error Boundary pattern for isolating one UI section's error. -->

# Error Boundary

A render error in one section, such as the product list, must not blank the whole page. Put the boundary around that section and show a way back.

Use query error state for fetch failures. A boundary is for render errors.

```tsx
<CatalogErrorBoundary>
  <ProductList />
</CatalogErrorBoundary>
```
